Just[ use] common sense. As[ long] as[ you][ don]'t drive[ into] any water deeper than 200mm, and[ you][ stick] to the[ road] and sealed parking b[ays] (i.e. don't pull off the road into any soft shoulders), there is no[ problem] at all. It's a normal[ highway].
